+/*    as specified by the caller.                                         */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*  INPUT                                                                 */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*    new_time                              New time value                */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*  OUTPUT                                                                */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*    None                                                                */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*  CALLS                                                                 */
+/*                                                                        */
