+/*    This function provides inserts an ISR entry event into the trace    */
+/*    buffer.                                                             */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*  INPUT                                                                 */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*    isr_id                                User defined ISR ID           */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*  OUTPUT                                                                */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*    None                                                                */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*  CALLS                                                                 */
+/*                                                                        */
