+/*    This function checks to make sure a thread is executing before the  */
+/*    relinquish is executed.                                             */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*  INPUT                                                                 */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*    None                                                                */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*  OUTPUT                                                                */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*    None                                                                */
