+/*  DESCRIPTION                                                           */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*    This function is responsible for disabling interrupts and returning */
+/*    the previous interrupt lockout posture.                             */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*  INPUT                                                                 */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*    None                                                                */
+/*                                                                        */
+/*  OUTPUT                                                                */
